1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,916
25 annos retro, Wikipedia esseva un sonio.

2
00:00:02,916 --> 00:00:06,791
Un sonio super-ambitiose,
probabilemente impossibile.

3
00:00:07,500 --> 00:00:09,541
Hodie: milliardos de lectores …

4
00:00:10,708 --> 00:00:13,458
… e centos de milles de redactores …

5
00:00:13,458 --> 00:00:16,750
… como un persona de vinti-qualque annos
in Tokio, o un patre in Lagos …

6
00:00:17,125 --> 00:00:20,125
… como un professor que revivifica
un lingua in periculo de disparition …

7
00:00:20,583 --> 00:00:23,583
… o un supporter que actualisa le punctos
al sono final del sibilo.

8
00:00:23,791 --> 00:00:26,791
Wikipedia ha devenite le ressource
principal del mundo.

9
00:00:26,958 --> 00:00:29,250
Quando tu cerca qualcosa, ecce illo.

10
00:00:29,250 --> 00:00:32,250
Quando tu adde qualcosa,
toto le mundo lo apprende.

11
00:00:32,250 --> 00:00:35,541
Es le cognoscentia de tote le humanitate,
e tu face parte de illo.

12
00:00:36,375 --> 00:00:38,250
Le IA studia Wikipedia.

13
00:00:38,250 --> 00:00:39,916
Le motores de recerca lo copia.

14
00:00:39,916 --> 00:00:42,000
Tu altoparlator intelligente
lo murmura retro a te.

15
00:00:42,000 --> 00:00:44,416
Ecce lo que io ha trovate sur Wikip--
Ehh… io vole dicer…

16
00:00:44,416 --> 00:00:45,291
…sur internet.

17
00:00:45,291 --> 00:00:46,583
E detra tote illo:

18
00:00:47,166 --> 00:00:49,125
personas.

19
00:00:49,708 --> 00:00:53,958
Arguente, modificante,
e de qualque maniera accordante se.

20
00:00:54,666 --> 00:00:57,916
In un mundo ubi muros de pagamento
e le reclamo pare esser le norma,

21
00:00:58,083 --> 00:01:02,416
Wikipedia es ancora libere,
gratuite, neutre, aperte, human.

22
00:01:02,750 --> 00:01:05,208
Es le internet que on nos ha promittite.

23
00:01:05,208 --> 00:01:06,708
25 annos de cognoscentia,

24
00:01:07,666 --> 00:01:10,375
25 annos de collaboration,

25
00:01:10,375 --> 00:01:12,625
25 annos de consenso,

26
00:01:12,625 --> 00:01:16,333
25 annos de humanitate in optime forma.

27
00:01:22,166 --> 00:01:24,541
Le futuro del cognoscentia
es in vostre manos.